<section aria-labelledby="status">
  <h2 id="status">What the setup status means</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>Waiting</dt><dd>Paste the prompt into your agent’s chat and give it time to start.</dd>
    <dt>Connected</dt><dd>Envoi has paired the agent and setup checks are running.</dd>
    <dt>Checked</dt><dd>Setup checks passed. Send the agent a message to try the connection.</dd>
    <dt>Setup needs attention</dt><dd>Ask your agent what failed. Find its error in <a href="/docs/fix/">Problems and fixes</a>, then select <strong>Check again</strong>.</dd>
  </dl>
</section>
